<title>MEXICO: Hylsamex Q2 EPS lower.</title>
<headline>Hylsamex Q2 EPS lower.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican steel company Hylsamex SA de CV on Wednesday reported a second-quarter earnings per share of 1.50 pesos.</p>
<p>That was down from an EPS of 2.09 pesos in the second quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>((--Monterrey bureau, +528 345-7617))</p>
